 <kendinikertenkelebek@me.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:02:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix(build): check ExcludeArch before loading actions.py

Builder.__init__ loads the recipe's actions.py (through set_build_type),
and only build() checked <ExcludeArch>. Recipes of x86-only packages can
run x86-specific code at import time: module-broadcom-wl reads the
installed kernel version at module level, so on aarch64 it failed with
"Can't find kernel version information file" instead of being reported
as excluded. Found while building every pisilinux/core recipe natively on
arm64.

The check moves into check_excluded_architecture(), called in __init__
before the actions script is loaded and still at the start of build().
---
 pisi/operations/build.py | 17 +++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pisi/operations/build.py b/pisi/operations/build.py
index 292bf71..c792642 100644
--- a/pisi/operations/build.py
+++ b/pisi/operations/build.py
@@ -228,6 +228,11 @@ class Builder:
 
         self.sourceArchives = pisi.sourcearchive.SourceArchives(self.spec)
 
+        # Before actions.py is loaded: some recipes of x86-only packages run
+        # x86-specific code at import time (e.g. read the installed kernel
+        # version), which would fail before an exclusion could be reported.
+        self.check_excluded_architecture()
+
         self.build_types = self.get_build_types()
 
         # Use an empty string for the default build
@@ -315,16 +320,20 @@ class Builder:
             return None
         return open(stateFile, "r").read()
 
-    def build(self):
-        """Build the package in one shot."""
-
+    def check_excluded_architecture(self):
+        """Raise ExcludedArchitectureException when <ExcludeArch> lists this
+        architecture. Aliases count too: arm64 excludes aarch64."""
         architecture = ctx.config.values.general.architecture
-        # Aliases count too: <ExcludeArch>arm64</ExcludeArch> excludes aarch64.
         if pisi.archinfo.excluded(architecture, self.spec.source.excludeArch):
             raise ExcludedArchitectureException(
                     _("pspec.xml avoids this package from building for '%s'")
                     % architecture)
 
+    def build(self):
+        """Build the package in one shot."""
+
+        self.check_excluded_architecture()
+
         ctx.ui.status(_("Building source package: %s")
                       % self.spec.source.name)
 
